OL,3,ATrump says 'largely true' Iran war to
OL,4,Ablame for Republican midterm losses but
OL,5,Ahe would 'do it again'
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says it's "largely true"
OL,8,Fthe Iran war is behind his Republican
OL,9,FParty's midterm losses but he'd "do it
OL,10,Fagain" if needed - what else did he say
OL,11,Fin his first on-camera comments?
OL,13,FEarlier, Vice-President JD Vance said
OL,14,Fthe war was "the reason we lost" - his
OL,15,Fcandid comments distance himself from
OL,16,FTrump, our Washington correspondent
OL,17,Fwrites
OL,19,FThe Democrats swept to victory in the
OL,20,Fmidterms, taking back both the Senate
OL,21,Fand the House from Republicans - see
OL,22,Fthe results in maps
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
