OL,6,
OL,7,FThe party picked up a string of
OL,8,Fvictories in Republican strongholds.
OL,9,FTwo are yet to be called - in Alaska
OL,10,Fthe process could take weeks while in
OL,11,FMississippi, more than 95% of the votes
OL,12,Fhave been counted
